ot/pull/111773.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-21T15:27:52Z"},"body":"Code font has two settings: one where you can choose between nothing, contextual alternates and custom OpenType settings. I basically copypasted the latter for the Main Font.\r\n\r\nTesting with the Inter font:\r\n\r\n- No settings:\r\n<img width=\"670\" height=\"87\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dcecbd96-668d-4cd4-8f78-b8370b46b82b\" />\r\n\r\n- With features:\r\n<img width=\"659\" height=\"85\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5a14275b-e09a-4ad5-91a7-f66d0dd13d03\" />\r\n\r\n- Description:\r\n<img width=\"638\" height=\"113\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9b3317e8-d327-43cd-ada2-1e0b000ca0b5\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nThe setting has a description telling the user to check what OpenType features are supported by the font they are using, with an example at the end.\r\n\r\nBy the way, Code Font Custom Variations seems to be unused. Was it removed by mistake somehow?","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.gi